        <p>Tell an agent the destination and your dates. We'll compare sailings across cruise lines for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dests">
        <a class="card big" href="tel:[PHONE DIGITS]" style="--img:none">
          <svg class="art" viewBox="0 0 400 500" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="400" height="500" fill="#2BB3B1"/><rect y="0" width="400" height="230" fill="#8FD9E8"/><circle cx="300" cy="110" r="46" fill="#FFE29A"/><path d="M0 230c70-14 130-14 200 0s130 14 200 0v270H0z" fill="#1C9C9A"/><path d="M0 300c70-12 130-12 200 0s130 12 200 0v200H0z" fill="#17807F"/><path d="M0 390h400v110H0z" fill="#F2DFB4"/><path d="M60 390c6-60 10-110 30-160" stroke="#5B4632" stroke-width="7" fill="none"/><path d="M90 230c-30-6-55 4-70 20M90 230c-6-26 6-46 26-56M90 230c26-14 52-10 70 6M90 230c20 8 34 26 36 46" stroke="#2E7D4F" stroke-width="12" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/></svg>
          <h3>Caribbean</h3>
